  "description": "The surveyor spends time at a powered station searching for steel, plasteel, uranium, gold or industrial components. Research speed affects discovery; a find is guaranteed after eight accumulated operator work-days. The 700 W instrument needs two advanced components among its construction inputs.\n\nThe result is a location, not delivered cargo. A caravan has thirty days to arrive, then a separate eleven-day exit countdown once the site map is generated. Human defenders may be present. Mining and hauling bring the finite deposit home; further surveys can find new sites.",
